<title>USA: VISX wins expedited review for product.</title>
<headline>VISX wins expedited review for product.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>VISX Inc said Tuesday the U.S. Food and Drug Administration has finished an initial review of VISX's's application to treat certain levels of myopic astimatism and granted it an expedited status.</p>
<p>The application covers VISX's STAR Excimer Laser System and its use for 0.75D to 4.50D of myopic astigmatism with 1.0D to 6.0D of myopia.</p>
<p>In notifying VISX, the FDA said &quot;no legally marketed device is available for the safe treatment of astigmatism ... and the alternative treatments being employed entail substantial risk of morbidity,&quot; according to VISX.</p>
</text>
